@startuml
title Workflow of Heedfulness with Skillful Qualities

start

:Understand "Heedfulness with regard to skillful qualities" as foundational;

if (Heedfulness Cultivated?) then (Yes)
  :Actively abandon unskillful qualities;
  :Actively cultivate skillful qualities
  (e.g., good conduct, persistence, mindfulness, concentration, discernment);
  :Maintain steadfast effort & not shirk duties;
  :Aspire for purity of virtue and view;

  fork
    :Develop Four Establishings of Mindfulness;
  fork again
    :Achieve "Knowing & Seeing" nature of phenomena;
  fork again
    :Abandon Craving and Action (Kamma);
  fork again
    :Guard oneself well;
  fork again
    :Support Right View with Virtue, Learning, Discussion, Tranquility, Insight;
  end fork

  :Achieve "Unfabricated" (Ending of passion, aversion, delusion);
  :Attain Awareness-release and Discernment-release;

  :End Suffering and Stress;
  :Realize Unbinding / Ultimate Peace and Freedom;
else (No / Heedlessness)
  :Mind tends to laziness or restlessness;
  :Concentration fails to develop correctly;
  :Defilement by passion and ignorance;
  :Increase in unskillful qualities
  (e.g., unvirtuous, envious, stingy, ignorance, unskillful thinking, wrong views);
  :Actions driven by "unknowing" state;

  :Experience Increased Suffering and Undesirable States;
  :Perpetuate Cycle of Wandering-on;
endif
stop

@enduml